      <title>Episode 1: ‘Letters to my mother’ with Kumi Naidoo - Jacana</title>
      <link>https://jacana.co.za/episode-1-letters-to-my-mother-with-kumi-naidoo-by-charles-leonard/</link>
      <description>What does a person do when losing both his mother – a working-class woman – and his son – a famous rapper – through suicide? Activist Kumi Naidoo bares his soul in this podcast about his moving book, “Letters to my Mother: the making of a troublemaker”.</description>
